sp.p:
Good, very good; it is so then: good, very good;
    let it be concealed awhile. 

Re-enter BERTRAM.


Mine honour's such a ring: My chastity's the jewel
              of our house, Bequeathed down from many ancestors;
                Which were the greatest obloquy i' the world In me to lose: thus your own proper wisdom Brings in the champion Honour on my part, Against your vain assault.
